24</BitSize><BitOffs>1568</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>conditionalshow</Name></Property></Properties></SubItem><Properties><Property><Name>PouType</Name><Value>FunctionBlock</Value></Property><Property><Name>conditionalshow_all_locals</Name></Property></Properties></DataType><DataType><Name>FB_Calc_CEHI_Geo</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ =============================================================
 FUNCTION_BLOCK：FB_Calc_CEHI_Geo
 MATLAB 对应关系：
   res.F = A + l_AF*[cos(th_af); sin(th_af)]
   res.G = C + (res.F - A)
   th_CH = th_af - angle_GCH
   res.H = C + l_CH*[cos(th_CH); sin(th_CH)]
   res.I = E + (res.H - res.C)
